<title>USA: York sets 3.8 mln share buyback program.</title>
<headline>York sets 3.8 mln share buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Pa. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>York International Corp said on Tuesday its board authorized the repurchase of up to 3.8 million shares of its common stock over the next four years.</p>
<p>Repurchased shares would be used to fund the employee stock purchase and the omnibus stock plans, the company said.</p>
<p>York International makes heating, ventilating, air conditioning and refrigeration products.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
